{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1735,1770p' docs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md; rg -n 'continuation-registers|machine-data\\\\?|request-sent|response-wait-entry' src/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/register.cljc src/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/stack.cljc src/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc; rg --files | rg '(clojuredart|core.cljd|dart.*portab|portab.*dart)'\"","aggregated_output":"## 12. Portability notes for the implementer\n\n1. **Nil-valued window keys (Dart, Node).** The window is built with\n   `select-keys` and encoded as `[r [:lit nil]]`; never filter `some?`\n   values; `frame-test/nil-valued-register-is-a-member` over row 22\n   (`(pair nil (next-of c))`, the nil operand evaluated before the read)\n   is the canary. Membership is always by `contains?`/key sets, never\n   `(get W r)`.\n2. **`for` over large seqs (Dart).** Row sets of the C4 modules run to\n   thousands of rows; build with `mapv`/`into`/`reduce`.\n3. **Reader whitespace before closers (Dart).** Pinned row sets are\n   Clojure data in `.cljc`, never EDN strings.\n4. **Duplicate protocol params (Dart).** `gc-children [_ _x]`\n   (`srvm-phase4b:semantic_register.cljc:386`); any new protocol method\n   in `layout` likewise.\n5. **Multi-key `assoc` on nil (Dart).** Frames and windows start from\n   `{}` (`handoff.cljc:1455-1457` records the trap).\n6. **Reader conditionals.** `#?(:cljd Object :clj Throwable :cljs :default)`\n   with `:cljd` first; `:clj`-only source-reading tests as `#?(:cljd nil :clj …)`.\n7. **Private var access (Dart).** Every function named in §8 is public;\n   no `#'`.\n8. **Sorted keys.** Window and bindings rows are sorted by Jing\n   canonical bytes of the key, never by host `sort` on mixed types.\n9. **Numeric classes (Node).** `pc`, `rd`, `r`, `site` are exact\n   integers; compare with `cbor/numeric-kind` before `=` on wire values\n   (`ucf/profile-engine`, `ucf.cljc:77-91`, is the template).\n10. **Fresh worktree.** `mise trust` and `npm ci` before the Node lane.\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/register.cljc:505:  (when-not (vm/machine-data? val)\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/register.cljc:508:  (if (:request-sent entry)\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/register.cljc:511:                (ffi/response-wait-entry entry (:call-id entry)))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/register.cljc:606:      :dao.stream/ok (blocked (ffi/response-wait-entry payload call-id))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/register.cljc:608:                                       :request-sent true\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/stack.cljc:22:   two-step lives in that restore, keyed on the entry keys `:request-sent`\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/stack.cljc:545:   - A `:request-sent` entry is a writer whose retained request has now been\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/stack.cljc:547:     call-out reader (`ffi/response-wait-entry`) and the machine stays\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/stack.cljc:564:  (if (:request-sent entry)\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/stack.cljc:567:                (ffi/response-wait-entry entry (:call-id entry)))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/stack.cljc:661:      :dao.stream/ok (blocked (ffi/response-wait-entry regs call-id))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn/stack.cljc:663:                                       :request-sent true\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:196:                              {:rule :continuation-registers,\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:199:                              {:rule :continuation-registers,\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:202:                                                (vm/machine-data? (nth p 1)))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:204:                              {:rule :continuation-registers,\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:208:                                           (vm/machine-data? frames))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:328:                            {:rule :continuation-registers})\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:330:                            {:rule :continuation-registers})\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:332:                                              (vm/machine-data? (nth p 1)))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:334:                            {:rule :continuation-registers})\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:347:                                         (vm/machine-data? frames))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:362:   :datom :type :id :request-sent :op])\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:373:                    (true? (:request-sent entry)) :ffi-writer\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:386:                   :type :id :request-sent :op]\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:399:                      (when-not (vm/machine-data? (:datom entry))\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/debruijn_register_effects.cljc:428:                            (when-not (vm/machine-data? (apply2/request-args req))\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
